text t_h_top "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Omega Online Compiler | Interplane</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Compile and run Omega (.om) programs in your browser with the seeded AArch64 compiler and kernel sandbox.\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/public/favicon.svg\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/public/style.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/omega/compile/play.css\"></head>\n<body><header class=\"site-head\"><div class=\"shell head-inner\"><a class=\"brand\" translate=\"no\" href=\"/\">interplane<i class=\"dot\">.</i></a><nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/omega/\">Omega</a><a href=\"/omega/write/\">Write</a><a href=\"/omega/compile/\" aria-current=\"page\">Compiler</a><a href=\"https://interplane.io/drakestapleton/omega-mv\">Source</a></nav></div></header>\n<main><section class=\"band tight\"><div class=\"shell\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Omega &middot; Online Compiler &middot; Zero JS</span><h1>Compile and run Omega</h1><p class=\"lede\">Write <code>.om</code> below and compile it on 64-bit Arm Linux with the seeded <code>omc</code> compiler. Programs run inside Omega's built-in <code>execpure</code> sandbox (Landlock + seccomp-BPF + resource caps).</p>\n<div class=\"pg-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-card\"><div class=\"pg-examples\"><span class=\"pg-lbl\">Examples:</span><a class=\"pg-ex\" href=\"/omega/compile/?example=hello\">hello</a><a class=\"pg-ex\" href=\"/omega/compile/?example=sum\">sum</a><a class=\"pg-ex\" href=\"/omega/compile/?example=fib\">fib</a><a class=\"pg-ex\" href=\"/omega/compile/?example=trap\">trap</a><a class=\"pg-ex\" href=\"/omega/compile/?example=typeerr\">type error</a></div>\n<form method=\"POST\" action=\"/omega/compile/\"><textarea class=\"pg-editor\" name=\"code\" rows=\"18\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"Omega source code\">"

